      "content": "i know people say it gets better, but everything feels so empty. i just look at his side of the bed and it feels like a hole in my chest. it’s not even about being sad anymore, it's just... i'm so tired. i'm so tired of fighting to belong in a world he isn't in. sometimes i think the only way to stop feeling this void is to just go where he is. does that make sense? does it seem crazy to want to be where the peace is?",
